ior when a user focuses on these input fields.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/* In-page Auto-fill badge & dropdown styles - Isolated namespace */\n\n.__offline_vault_badge {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 22px;\n  height: 22px;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  background: #090d16;\n  border: 1px solid #10b981;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  z-index: 2147483646;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n  transition: transform 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_badge:hover {\n  transform: scale(1.1);\n  border-color: #34d399;\n  background: #111827;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_badge svg {\n  width: 14px;\n  height: 14px;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_dropdown {\n  position: absolute;\n  background: #111827;\n  border: 1px solid #26334d;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n  padding: 0.75rem;\n  z-index: 2147483647;\n  width: 260px;\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  color: #f8fafc;\n  animation: __offline_vault_fade_in 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n@keyframes __offline_vault_fade_in {\n  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-4px); }\n  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n  padding-bottom: 0.35rem;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #1f293d;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #10b981;\n  font-size: 12px;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_item {\n  background: #1a2234;\n  border: 1px solid #26334d;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  padding: 0.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_user {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #f8fafc;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_actions {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_btn {\n  flex: 1;\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  border: none;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.15s ease;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_btn_fill {\n  background: #10b981;\n  color: #042f2e;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_btn_fill:hover {\n  background: #059669;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_btn_copy {\n  background: #26334d;\n  color: #f8fafc;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_btn_copy:hover {\n  background: #374665;\n}\n\n.__offline_vault_notice {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #94a3b8;\n  padding: 0.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n","Description":"Create content.css with scoped in-page styling","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\vijay\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\offline-vault-extension\\content.css","toolAction":"Creating content.css","toolSummary":"Create content.css"}}]}
