{"step_index":115,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T06:55:29Z","content":"The **Chrome / Edge Browser Extension** with automatic in-page auto-fill and quick-copy has been created in:\n`C:\\Users\\vijay\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\offline-vault-extension`\n\n---\n\n### How to Install in Chrome or Edge (Takes 30 Seconds)\n\n1. **Open the Extensions Page**:\n   - In **Google Chrome**: go to `chrome://extensions`\n   - In **Microsoft Edge**: go to `edge://extensions`\n2. **Turn on Developer Mode**:\n   - Toggle **\"Developer mode\"** in the top right corner to **ON**.\n3. **Load the Extension**:\n   - Click the **\"Load unpacked\"** button in the top left.\n   - Select this folder:\n     ```text\n     C:\\Users\\vijay\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\offline-vault-extension\n     ```\n4. Click the puzzle icon in your browser toolbar and **pin** the **Offline Vault (🛡️)** icon.\n\n---\n\n### How to Use Auto-Fill on GitHub\n\n1. Click the **🛡️ Offline Vault** icon in your browser toolbar.\n2. Set your master password to initialize your vault.\n3. Click **＋ Add** and save your GitHub account:\n   - **Title**: `GitHub`\n   - **Username**: `your-email@gmail.com`\n   - **Password**: your password\n   - **Website URL**: `github.com`\n   - Click **Save Encrypted**.\n4. Now open **https://github.com/login**:\n   - You will see a small **green shield icon (🛡️)** right inside the login & password inputs!\n   - Click it and select **⚡ Auto-Fill** — it will automatically populate your username and password!\n   - Or click **📋 Copy** to copy the password directly to your clipboard.\n   - You can also click the toolbar icon anytime and press **\"⚡ Fill on Tab\"**.\n\n---\n\n### Security & Privacy Guarantee\n- **100% Offline**: Strict Content Security Policy (`connect-src 'none'`). No network calls can ever occur.\n- **Client-Side AES-256-GCM**: All passwords in local extension storage are encrypted using your master password.\n- **Zero-Knowledge**: Your master password is never saved anywhere.\n\nFor details, refer to [`walkthrough.md`](file:///C:/Users/vijay/.gemini/antigravity/brain/0fddf4ef-d93f-406e-8ec9-d51e8406f759/walkthrough.md) and [`README.md`](file:///C:/Users/vijay/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/offline-vault-extension/README.md)."}
